        "author": "Carrie M.",
        "date": "2025-10-18T17:28:04Z",
        "id": "68f3dd058ac6840a6da655db",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Amazing property! Stunning views and direct beach access. Super clean and the kitchen was well equipped! We will be back for sure!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Addie L.",
        "date": "2025-11-02T01:16:51Z",
        "id": "6906bfc3033039781780459d",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Everything was PERFECT! The communication was great. The amenities were great. The location was perfect. Our favorite part is how close it was to beach front…not busy and literally a couple steps to your beach chairs! The house was stocked with every single thing you could ever need and more! Would definitely stay again!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Julie D.",
        "date": "2025-05-26T14:19:05Z",
        "id": "683539894e89fc1cd2ddc5bd",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "What a beautiful home! We travel a lot and this is by far the most well equipped home we've stayed at. The beds were so comfortable and the kitchen well stocked! Can't wait to come back!",
        "title": "Perfect!"
      },
      {
        "author": "Prudence B.",
        "date": "2025-12-27T23:21:10Z",
        "id": "6950ba1c2ea6b958dd77622b",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "This is a wonderful house in a beautiful location on the beach. It is amazingly well appointed. We cooked many meals in a kitchen that is much better equipped than the one at home! Also the bikes, the sand toys, the umbrella etc make walking out of the house onto the beach a lovely experience. The Concierge Cottages staff were incredibly responsive to our particular needs (with a toddler and a 6-month old), and very helpful re other questions. We couldn't have been happier and recommend this property with no hesitation. If there was one property upgrade we might recommend it would be the mattress in the downstairs bedroom. Thank you so much for a great week!",
        "title": "Beautiful Vacation"
      },
      {
        "author": "Nick A.",
        "date": "2025-05-23T13:58:51Z",
        "id": "683145009b29f858d634dfd7",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Beautiful home. Well appointed. Had everything we needed. Smooth check-in/out. No issues. Walk out of the house and you're on the beach. Very nice to not have 100 umbrellas taking up the beach as they do in Rosemary, but yet you are still close enough to Rosemary to ride over to the restaurants/shops. We'll definitely stay here again!",
        "title": "Wonderful!"
      }
    ],
